        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A smaller extra arm grafted at the flank. It can't wield a weapon well (–2 if you try) but it can hold, carry, brace, reload, steady a shield, or maintain a grapple. You have a third hand for Interact actions; draw or stow one item as a free action once per turn; +1 item bonus to Athletics to Climb and to checks to do two manual things at once.</p><p><b>Donor:</b> Three-handed now. The arm keeps its own small habits — reaching for door-frames, worrying at a loose thread, catching things before you notice they're falling.</p>"
